      "body": "您好，Committer [@handyohos](https://gitcode.com/handyohos) [@csliutt-private](https://gitcode.com/csliutt-private) [@ringking0](https://gitcode.com/ringking0) ，请分配检视人员检视该PR，可以通过命令\"assign [@someone_id]\"分配检视人员，也可以直接评论\"assign\"分配给自己进行检视。<br></br><br>Hello, Committer [@handyohos](https://gitcode.com/handyohos) [@csliutt-private](https://gitcode.com/csliutt-private) [@ringking0](https://gitcode.com/ringking0) . Please assign someone to review the PR. You can assign a reviewer by using the command \"assign [@someone_id]\", or you can comment \"assign\" to review the PR by yourself.</br>",
